<title>USA: Carmike goal to build 300 screens in 1997.</title>
<headline>Carmike goal to build 300 screens in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ga. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carmike Cinemas Inc Tuesday said its goal in 1997 is to build an additional 300 screens in markets where the firm is, or has the potential to be the dominant exhibitor.</p>
<p>The company said it will continue to pursue acquisition candidates.</p>
<p>Carmike currently operates 2,519 motion picture screens in 33 states.</p>
